Fix: gev (and any family whose initialize calls family$ll) fails with nested effects
('subscript out of bounds'). The reduced designs built by .backfit_si_initialize contain only
standard effects, so the bundle initialisation must get the standard family of the same bundle.
Apply:   git apply fix_gev_nested_init.patch      Undo:   git apply -R fix_gev_nested_init.patch

--- a/R/build_family_nl.R
+++ b/R/build_family_nl.R
@@ -52,8 +52,10 @@
     
